        ptr = memchr(data, 0, size - 1);
        return ptr ? ++ptr : NULL;
}
```

`get_word` returns NULL if `*data == 0`. So an empty word (starting with NUL) would cause `get_word` to return NULL, and `extract_word` would return NULL.

